{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>History awaits your command!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u201cSamurai Conqueror\u201d</strong> is a <strong>Historical Timeline Strategy</strong> game where you unify Japanese history, spanning from the Kofun to the Meiji era.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose a legendary leader to command your faction, expand your influence across eras, and bring the entirety of Japanese history under your rule.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430910/extras/3bd0127e56bd8cca59d92d39c286dce9.avif?t=1759704369\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relive and rewrite history through decisive events such as the <i>Taika Reform</i>, the <i>Genpei War</i>, the <i>\u014cnin War</i>, the <i>Battle of Sekigahara</i>, and the <i>Meiji Restoration</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430910/extras/fef3b95af629d1709cfe86a940154320.avif?t=1759704369\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Key Features</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lead a Legend \u2013</strong> Choose one historical figure from Japanese history to guide your faction.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Power \u2013</strong> Strengthen commerce, farming, culture, and military through strategic development.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-time play \u2013</strong>\u00a0pause anytime to plan.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rewrite History \u2013</strong> Invade rival factions and expand your realm in the struggle to unify Japan across time.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3430910?t=1759704369","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3430910?t=1759704369","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430910/692a20b55832be984351c1f5b4861f46a6b56299/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759704369","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430910/692a20b55832be984351c1f5b4861f46a6b56299/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759704369","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3978640,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>History awaits your command!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u201cSamurai Conqueror\u201d</strong> is a <strong>Historical Timeline Strategy</strong> game where you unify Japanese history, spanning from the Kofun to the Meiji era.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose a legendary leader to command your faction, expand your influence across eras, and bring the entirety of Japanese history under your rule.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430910/extras/3bd0127e56bd8cca59d92d39c286dce9.avif?t=1759704369\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relive and rewrite history through decisive events such as the <i>Taika Reform</i>, the <i>Genpei War</i>, the <i>\u014cnin War</i>, the <i>Battle of Sekigahara</i>, and the <i>Meiji Restoration</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_i